In case it's helpful, the implementation in tinyVAST is here <https://github.com/vast-lib/tinyVAST/blob/main/src/tinyVAST.cpp#L456-L460>.  The term `log_one_minus_mu1`  helps with numerical overflow in calculating the Bernoulli (presence/absence) term.

